  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 9.1, 'Summary of outputs towards a costed investment plan'. A grid of nine tiles, one per component, each tagged with its chapter and listing its ticked outputs. 01 Actors (team, stakeholders, beneficiaries) and 02 Priorities (within the health programme and system, within the digital health strategy), both from chapter 2. 03 Programme context (personas and organigram, pain points, health system challenges and needs, current-state workflow diagrams). 04 Digital context (prioritized digital interventions, maturity and readiness, functional requirements, future-state workflow, digital inventory). 06 Architecture (current and future architecture, standards and interoperability, point-of-service applications, shared services), with a tile for common services across sectors. 05 Implementation (implementation plan, enabling environment). 07 Budget (phases and costs, financing). 08 Monitoring (logic model, monitoring and evaluation, adaptive management). 09 Value proposition.",
